Description: glamor: offload copies to the A20 G2D (sun4i-mp DRM driver)
 Copies between pixmaps backed by physically contiguous dma-bufs (the scanout
 front buffer, DRI3 client buffers from kmsro) are done by the Allwinner A20
 mixer processor through DRM_IOCTL_SUN4I_MP_BLIT instead of a Mali job.
 Everything else falls back to the unchanged GL path. Enabled when a render
 node named "sun4i-mp" exists; XSERVER_G2D=0 or Option "G2DAccel" "off"
 disables it.
Author: D.R.racer <drracer@seznam.cz>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-20
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
